      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "This equals \\(\\lim _{h \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{x^{2}-x^{2}-h^{2}-2 h x}{h}=\\lim _{h \\rightarrow 0}-h-2 x=-2 x\\). Alternate Solution: This is the definition of the derivative of \\(-x^{2}\\) with respect to \\(x\\), which is \\(-2 x\\).",
